<title>UK: Cemig sets $150 million eight-year bond.</title>
<headline>Cemig sets $150 million eight-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CIA ENERGETICA DE MINAS GERAIS</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     9.125     MATURITY    18.NOV.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.582    PAY DATE    18.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.75	REOFFER    99.582    SPREAD	+300 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/BZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.375     LISTING     LUX,PORTL</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FIVE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY.</p>
<p> NOTES	CALL AND PUT OPTIONS ON 18.NOV.01AT 98.704.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
